160
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:08,000
Subsequently, we decided that that culprit lesion was left circumflexed, and then we did a PCI to the second marginal with a BCV and a drangeloid extent.

161
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:15,000
Here you can see the images of the coronary angiogram of the right coronary artery, of the left system, and of the PCI.

162
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:23,000
